Here is the complete Java code to calculate the final fees for all subscribers:

```java
public void calculateFees() {
    int totalMovies = 0;
    for (int i = 0; i < count; i++) {
        totalMovies += subscribers[i].getMoviesWatched();
    }
    double addDiscount = 0;
    if (totalMovies >= 20) addDiscount = 3;
    else if (totalMovies >= 10) addDiscount = 2;

    for (int i = 0; i < count; i++) {
        double baseFee = getBaseFee(subscribers[i].getPlan());
        double finalFee = baseFee * (1 - (discountPercentage + addDiscount) / 100.0);
        subscribers[i].setFinalFee(finalFee);
    }
}
```
