Here is the complete Java code to count the plan types and find the subscriber with the highest final fee:

```java
int basic = 0, standard = 0, premium = 0;
double maxFee = -1;
int maxFeeIndex = 0;

for (int i = 0; i < n; i++) {
    if (subscribers[i].plan.equalsIgnoreCase("Basic")) basic++;
    else if (subscribers[i].plan.equalsIgnoreCase("Standard")) standard++;
    else if (subscribers[i].plan.equalsIgnoreCase("Premium")) premium++;

    if (subscribers[i].finalFee > maxFee) {
        maxFee = subscribers[i].finalFee;
        maxFeeIndex = i;
    }
}
System.out.println("Highest fee subscriber ID: " + subscribers[maxFeeIndex].id);
```

