Here is the code to calculate the final fees and track plan counts:

```java
int basicCount = 0, standardCount = 0, premiumCount = 0;
for (int i = 0; i < n; i++) {
    if (subscribers[i].plan.equalsIgnoreCase("Basic")) basicCount++;
    else if (subscribers[i].plan.equalsIgnoreCase("Standard")) standardCount++;
    else if (subscribers[i].plan.equalsIgnoreCase("Premium")) premiumCount++;

    double monthly = subscribers[i].plan.equalsIgnoreCase("Basic") ? 299 : (subscribers[i].plan.equalsIgnoreCase("Standard") ? 499 : 799);
    subscribers[i].finalFee = monthly * (1 - (festivalDiscount + additionalDiscount) / 100.0);
}
System.out.println("Basic: " + basicCount + ", Standard: " + standardCount + ", Premium: " + premiumCount);
```

